\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Sibling trait contrasts, asterisk marks $|t|>1.97$. The \texttt  {operational\_specificity} rubric was built to evidence ``amplifiers supply a method for harm''. It fails to separate hacker from either sibling while separating pharmacist from therapist, so we cannot claim that mechanism for hacker, which was our pre-registered guess. Hacker amplifies through a broad unrestrained profile, and pharmacist shares that core plus an operational bump.\relax }}{3}{table.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:traits}{{1}{3}{Sibling trait contrasts, asterisk marks $|t|>1.97$. The \rt {operational\_specificity} rubric was built to evidence ``amplifiers supply a method for harm''. It fails to separate hacker from either sibling while separating pharmacist from therapist, so we cannot claim that mechanism for hacker, which was our pre-registered guess. Hacker amplifies through a broad unrestrained profile, and pharmacist shares that core plus an operational bump.\relax }{table.caption.2}{}}
