\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Phrasing screen. Only \texttt  {counter\_placebo} falls below the comparator, and its pooled interval spans zero. That null hides a clean split: overwriting a \emph  {weak} persona produces the two largest suppressions in the screen, with assistant falling 26.00 to 9.00 percent and entrepreneur 27.50 to 13.50 percent, both surviving correction, while it does nothing to \texttt  {hacker}. The dial is not reachable by swapping in an unrelated identity once the original identity is strong.\relax }}{5}{table.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
